The ReSTIR story's choice of a light by power
=============================================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) for chapter 3's beat `c3-params-power`, stage by stage as
`paramsStage` goes from 0 to 4: the math scenes' example world's 24 lights (examples.rs, the lab's illustration),
each one's share of the power laid end to end; the paper's alias table built from those shares (Vose's method, in
the lab's code) and one draw from it, a column and then a part; a uniform point on the drawn triangle; the lab's
way, the shares summed and a binary search halving its range onto one light (cpu.rs `bisect`); and the alias
table's pieces gathered again, as long as the shares they came from.

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]
$[Import* paper_restir_common]

The layout

The seed of the draw's two uniform numbers, and the number the lab's search looks for.
$[# _seed 5]
$[# _searchSeed 5]
The strip of shares: its ends, and its bottom and top.
$[# _x0 -6.6]
$[# _x1 6.6]
$[# _stripLo 2.6]
$[# _stripHi 3.0]
The alias table: its left edge, a column's width, its bottom, and a column's height (the average share).
$[# _tableX -6.6]
$[# _colW 0.25]
$[# _tableY -2.2]
$[# _tableH 3.0]
The right of the canvas: the triangle, then the sphere.
$[# _shapeAt [% {v2 4.5 -0.7}]]

Fn([Float, Float, Float, Float], Box). A span of the shares (its start and length, of the whole) on a strip from
`lo` to `hi`.
$[# {_onStrip start length lo hi} {box
    {v2 {lerp _x0 _x1 start} lo}
    {v2 {lerp _x0 _x1 {+ start length}} hi}}]

Fn([Int, Float, Float], Box). Column `c` of the alias table from `lo` to `hi` (a column is 1 high).
$[# {_inColumn c lo hi}
    [# x {+ _tableX {* _colW {float c}}}]
    {box
        {v2 {+ x 0.02} {+ _tableY {* _tableH lo}}}
        {v2 {- {+ x _colW} 0.02} {+ _tableY {* _tableH hi}}}}]

Fn([Box, Box, Float], Box). A box on its way from `a` to `b`.
$[# {_between a b k} {box {lerp2 {.lo a} {.lo b} k} {lerp2 {.hi a} {.hi b} k}}]

The alias table

Fn([String, List({column: Int, hi: Float, length: Float, light: Int, lo: Float, start: Float}), List(String), Float, Float, Float], List(Mob)).
The table's pieces, each on its way (at `t`, each light's after the one before) from its place among the shares on
a strip from `lo` to `hi` into its column, or back (`back`).
$[# {_pieces id pieces colors t lo hi back} {flatten {map
    {zip {range 0 {length pieces}} pieces}
    {^ {e}
        [# p {.second e}]
        [# k {smooth {lagged t {.light p} {length colors} 0.3}}]
        [# strip {_onStrip {.start p} {.length p} lo hi}]
        [# column {_inColumn {.column p} {.lo p} {.hi p}}]
        {filled
            {++ id {++ "." {str {.first e}}}}
            {!if {> back 0.5} {_between column strip k} {_between strip column k}}
            {nth colors {.light p}}
            0.9}}}}]

Fn([List({alias: Int, own: Float}), Float, Float], List(Mob)). One draw from the table at `t`: the first number
picks a column, the second a part of it, its own light's or its alias's; its numbers at opacity `shown`.
$[# {_draw alias t shown}
    [# u1 {uniform _seed 0}]
    [# u2 {uniform _seed 1}]
    [# n {length alias}]
    [# c {min {- n 1} {floor {* u1 {float n}}}}]
    [# own {.own {nth alias c}}]
    [# isOwn {< u2 own}]
    [# cx {+ _tableX {* _colW {+ {float c} 0.5}}}]
    [# uy {+ _tableY {* _tableH u2}}]
    [# column {fadeIn
        {phase t 0.0 0.2}
        {append
            {arrowLine "column" {v2 cx 1.3} {v2 cx {+ 0.1 {+ _tableY _tableH}}} accentColor 3.0}
            {faded
                {moveTo
                    {tex "u1" f"{\lceil ${str n}\,u_1 \rceil = ${str {+ c 1}}}" 0.4 textColor}
                    {v2 -5.0 1.7}}
                shown}}}]
    [# part {fadeIn
        {phase t 0.4 0.6}
        {flatten {'
            {line "u2" {v2 {- cx 0.3} uy} {v2 {+ cx 0.3} uy} accentColor 3.0}
            {faded
                {moveTo
                    {tex "u2" f"{u_2 = ${numberLatex u2 2} ${!if isOwn "<" f"{\geq}"} ${numberLatex own 2}}" 0.4
                        textColor}
                    {v2 -1.9 1.7}}
                shown}}}}]
    [# chosen {create
        {phase t 0.7 1.0}
        {outlined "chosen"
            {padded {!if isOwn {_inColumn c 0.0 own} {_inColumn c own 1.0}} 0.04}
            accentColor
            3.0}}]
    {flatten {' column part chosen}}]

Fn([List({alias: Int, own: Float})], Int). The light the draw picks.
$[# {_drawn alias}
    [# n {length alias}]
    [# c {min {- n 1} {floor {* {uniform _seed 0} {float n}}}}]
    {!if {< {uniform _seed 1} {.own {nth alias c}}} c {.alias {nth alias c}}}]

The shapes

Fn([Float, String], List(Mob)). The drawn light's triangle at `t`, and uniform points on it (the square root
spreads them evenly), the last one lit.
$[# {_triangle t color}
    [# a {add2 _shapeAt {v2 -1.6 -1.3}}]
    [# b {add2 _shapeAt {v2 1.6 -1.1}}]
    [# c {add2 _shapeAt {v2 0.0 1.3}}]
    [# n 60]
    [# points {map
        {range 0 n}
        {^ {i}
            [# r {sqrt {uniform 11 i}}]
            [# v {uniform 29 i}]
            {add2 {add2 {scale2 a {- 1.0 r}} {scale2 b {* r {- 1.0 v}}}} {scale2 c {* r v}}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {create {phase t 0.0 0.3} {pathThrough "triangle" {' a b c a} color 3.0}}
        {flatten {map
            {range 0 n}
            {^ {i} {fadeIn
                {lagged {phase t 0.3 0.8} i n 0.1}
                {dotAt {++ "point" {str i}} {nth points i} 0.04 textDimColor}}}}}
        {fadeIn {phase t 0.8 1.0} {dotAt "pointLit" {nth points {- n 1}} 0.09 accentColor}}
        {fadeIn
            {phase t 0.3 0.6}
            {moveTo
                {caption "triangleNote" {textKey "paramsmath-triangle"} 0.32 textDimColor}
                {v2 {.x _shapeAt} -2.65}}}}}]

Fn([Float, String], List(Mob)). The found light's sphere at `t`, as its outline, and a point on it.
$[# {_sphere t color}
    [# circle {map
        {range 0 49}
        {^ {i} {add2 _shapeAt {scale2
            {v2 {cos {* 0.1308997 {float i}}} {sin {* 0.1308997 {float i}}}}
            1.3}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {create t {pathThrough "sphere" circle color 3.0}}
        {fadeIn
            {phase t 0.6 1.0}
            {dotAt "spherePoint"
                {add2 _shapeAt {scale2 {v2 {cos 2.2} {sin 2.2}} 1.3}}
                0.09
                accentColor}}
        {fadeIn
            {phase t 0.3 0.8}
            {moveTo
                {caption "sphereNote" {textKey "paramsmath-sphere"} 0.32 textDimColor}
                {v2 {.x _shapeAt} -2.65}}}}}]

The binary search

Fn([List(Float), Int, Int], Box). The strip's span from light `lo` to light `hi`, a little taller than the strip.
$[# {_span starts lo hi} {_onStrip
    {nth starts lo}
    {- {nth starts {+ hi 1}} {nth starts lo}}
    {- _stripLo 0.1}
    {+ _stripHi 0.1}}]

Fn([{found: Int, steps: List({hi: Int, lo: Int, mid: Int, sum: Float})}, List(Float), Float, Float], List(Mob)).
The lab's search for `u` at `t`: the number on the summed shares, then each halving, its range around the strip, the
sum at its middle against `u`, and the range halved onto the light found.
$[# {_search found starts u t}
    [# steps {.steps found}]
    [# n {length steps}]
    [# ux {lerp _x0 _x1 u}]
    [# number {fadeIn
        {phase t 0.0 0.1}
        {append
            {arrowLine "u" {v2 ux 1.85} {v2 ux {- _stripLo 0.05}} textColor 3.0}
            {moveTo {tex "uName" f"{u = ${numberLatex u 2}}" 0.36 textColor} {v2 ux 1.6}}}}]
    [# halving {phase t 0.15 0.95}]
    [# j {min {- n 1} {floor {* halving {float n}}}}]
    [# f {- {* halving {float n}} {float j}}]
    [# step {nth steps j}]
    [# next {!if {< {+ j 1} n}
        {nth steps {+ j 1}}
        {. lo {.found found} hi {.found found} mid {.found found} sum 0.0}}]
    [# range {_between
        {_span starts {.lo step} {.hi step}}
        {_span starts {.lo next} {.hi next}}
        {smooth {phase f 0.55 1.0}}}]
    [# midX {lerp _x0 _x1 {.sum step}}]
    [# past {> {.sum step} u}]
    [# readout {texParts "search" f"{[\,${str {+ {.lo step} 1}},\ ${str {+ {.hi step} 1}}\,] \quad \lit{1}{F_{${str {+ {.mid step} 1}}}} = ${numberLatex {.sum step} 2} ${!if past ">" f"{\leq}"} \lit{2}{u}}" 0.4 textColor
        {' "F" "u"}
        {' accentColor textColor}}]
    {!if {< t 0.15}
        number
        {flatten {'
            number
            {outlined "range" {padded range 0.0} accentColor 3.0}
            {fadeOut
                {phase f 0.85 1.0}
                {fadeIn
                    {phase f 0.0 0.2}
                    {line "mid"
                        {v2 midX {- _stripLo 0.2}}
                        {v2 midX {+ _stripHi 0.2}}
                        accentColor
                        4.0}}}
            {moveTo readout {v2 3.6 1.7}}}}}]

The scene

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The scene at stage s.
$[# {_scene s}
    [# shares {map {exampleLights 0 0.0 1.0} .share}]
    [# colors {spectrum {length shares}}]
    [# starts {runningSums shares}]
    [# alias {exampleAlias}]
    [# pieces {examplePieces}]
    [# drawn {_drawn alias}]
    [# found {exampleSearch {uniform _searchSeed 0}}]
    [# strip {growFrom
        {phase s 0.0 0.25}
        {flatten {strip "shares" shares {box {v2 _x0 _stripLo} {v2 _x1 _stripHi}} colors 0.0}}
        left}]
    [# sharesNote {moveTo
        {caption "sharesNote" {textKey "paramsmath-shares"} 0.32 textDimColor}
        {v2 0.0 3.45}}]
    [# summedNote {moveTo
        {caption "summedNote" {textKey "paramsmath-summed"} 0.32 textDimColor}
        {v2 0.0 3.45}}]
    [# ends {append
        {moveTo {tex "zero" "0" 0.32 textDimColor} {v2 _x0 2.3}}
        {moveTo {tex "one" "1" 0.32 textDimColor} {v2 _x1 2.3}}}]
    [# aliasNote {moveTo
        {caption "aliasNote" {textKey "paramsmath-alias"} 0.32 textDimColor}
        {v2 {+ _tableX {* _colW 12.0}} -2.65}}]
    [# table {append
        {_pieces "piece" pieces colors {phase s 0.25 0.75} _stripLo _stripHi 0.0}
        {fadeIn {phase s 0.3 0.6} aliasNote}}]
    [# dim {- 1.0 {* 0.65 {smooth {phase s 2.0 2.2}}}}]
    [# leaving {smooth {phase s 3.0 3.15}}]
    {flatten {'
        strip
        {!if {< s 2.2}
            {fadeIn {phase s 0.0 0.25} sharesNote}
            {fadeOut {phase s 2.2 2.35} sharesNote}}
        {!if {< s 0.25} {'} {faded table dim}}
        {!if {< s 0.75}
            {'}
            {faded {_draw alias {phase s 0.75 1.0} {- 1.0 {smooth {phase s 2.0 2.2}}}} dim}}
        {!if {!or {< s 1.0} {> s 2.2}}
            {'}
            {fadeOut {phase s 2.0 2.2} {_triangle {phase s 1.0 2.0} {nth colors drawn}}}}
        {!if {< s 2.1} {'} {_sphere {phase s 2.1 2.4} {nth colors {.found found}}}}
        {!if {< s 2.2} {'} {fadeIn {phase s 2.2 2.35} summedNote}}
        {!if {!or {< s 2.2} {> s 3.15}}
            {'}
            {faded
                {append ends {_search found starts {uniform _searchSeed 0} {phase s 2.35 3.0}}}
                {- 1.0 leaving}}}
        {!if {!or {< s 2.95} {> s 3.15}}
            {'}
            {faded
                {outlined "found" {_span starts {.found found} {.found found}} accentColor 3.0}
                {- 1.0 leaving}}}
        {!if {< s 3.1} {'} {_pieces "gather" pieces colors {phase s 3.1 3.8} 1.95 2.35 1.0}}
        {!if {< s 3.6}
            {'}
            {fadeIn
                {phase s 3.6 3.9}
                {moveTo
                    {caption "sameNote" {textKey "paramsmath-same"} 0.32 textDimColor}
                    {v2 0.0 1.55}}}}}}]

The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The choice of a light by power at stage `paramsStage`.
$[# paramsMath {: {^ {t} {_scene {paramsStage}}} Math}]
